                                        <article class="company-news-box js-company-news-box" id="technical-maintenance-on-july-10-2026-23-00-04-00-cest">
            <div class="company-news-box-date">14:00</div>
        <div class="company-news-box-title-wrapper">
        <h2 class="company-news-box-title">Technical maintenance on July 10, 2026 (23:00 - 04:00 CEST)</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="company-news-box-text-wrapper js-company-news-box-text-wrapper">
            <div class="company-news-box-text js-company-news-box-text"><p>Dear Clients,</p>

<p><br />
We would like to inform you about the&nbsp;technical maintenance&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;internal systems on Friday,&nbsp;10/07/2026, between&nbsp;23:00 CEST and 04:00 CEST.<br />
Please note that access to the&nbsp;registration forms&nbsp;and&nbsp;Client Office&nbsp;will&nbsp;not be available.<br />
The option to make&nbsp;card payments&nbsp;will&nbsp;remain available.</p>

<p><br />
Kind Regards,<br />
XTB</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="company-news-box-more-wrapper">
            <button class="company-news-box-more js-company-news-box-more">
