<p style="margin-bottom:13px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:Cambria,serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">This information applies to the above-mentioned instruments available in all offers on the xStation and MT4 platforms. Please note that the names of the instruments in individual offers may be slightly different. A detailed list of all instrument names are available in MARGIN TABLE.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p align="center" style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:13px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:Cambria,serif"><b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">OMI instruments, Stocks CFD, ETF CFD, Synthetic Stocks</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

